@demo13_HostAddress = http://localhost:5134

### Instructor: crear
POST {{demo13_HostAddress}}/api/instructores
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombres": "Ana",
  "apellidos": "García",
  "especialidad": "Matemáticas",
  "email": "ana.garcia@example.com",
  "activo": true
}

### Instructor: listar
GET {{demo13_HostAddress}}/api/instructores
Accept: application/json

### Instructor: consultar por ID
GET {{demo13_HostAddress}}/api/instructores/1
Accept: application/json

### Instructor: actualizar
PUT {{demo13_HostAddress}}/api/instructores/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idInstructor": 1,
  "nombres": "Ana María",
  "apellidos": "García",
  "especialidad": "Matemáticas",
  "email": "ana.garcia@example.com",
  "activo": true
}

### Instructor: eliminar
DELETE {{demo13_HostAddress}}/api/instructores/1

